    <item>
      <title>Lurar 0.11.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 19:22:04 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>33</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3 dir="auto">Features</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Hz/kHz selection for EQ band frequencies, and stop rounding them (<a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/commit/641eb1cb431a0b1f635b46a528af1f0b8c6c54ed">641eb1c</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/issues/144" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/lsjoberg/lurar/issues/144/hovercard">#144</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>importing an exported catalog preset no longer creates an undeletable twin (<a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/commit/81f1ab321b7e3b41bb88632bbb34edc2bdd2c68a">81f1ab3</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/issues/144" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/lsjoberg/lurar/issues/144/hovercard">#144</a></li>
<li>point the Help menu at the docs instead of a missing help book (<a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/commit/50884d50398bfa889b32ecf5f8732313703a136f">50884d5</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/issues/144" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/lsjoberg/lurar/issues/144/hovercard">#144</a></li>
<li>rebuild the tap for apps that start playing after the engine did (<a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/commit/fb1d43d4439ca64fd49306ac3592f43248f761bb">fb1d43d</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/issues/144" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/lsjoberg/lurar/issues/144/hovercard">#144</a></li>
<li>stretch the Excluded Apps settings tab to fill the window (<a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/commit/5263803ef44cc23b09b151f40f761476ee62f759">5263803</a>), closes <a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/issues/144" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/lsjoberg/lurar/issues/144/hovercard">#144</a></li>
</ul><p style="margin-top:1.5em;font-size:0.9em"><a href="https://github.com/lsjoberg/lurar/releases/tag/v0.11.0">View full release on GitHub →</a></p>]]></description>
